    "text": "regulations made by the Minister of Finance under Section 29 read with Section 7 of the Foreign Exchange Act, No. 12 of 2017. Ranil Wickremesinghe, Minister of Finance, Economic Stabilization and National Policies.Colombo,14th February, 2024.Regulations",
    "fonts": [
